  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nOption 1) 56 – 31 – 205\n\n__(56 × 2)__ + __**(31 × 3)**__ = 205\n\n__112 + 93__ = 205\n\n205 = 205 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) 88 – 23 – 245\n\n__(88 × 2)__ + __(23 × 3)__ = 245\n\n__176 + 69__ = 245\n\n245 = 245 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 22 – 13 – 85\n\n__(22 × 2)__ + __(13 × 3)__ = 85\n\n__44 + 39__ = 85\n\n**83 ≠ 85 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 18 – 12 – 72\n\n__(18 × 2)__ + __(12 × 3)__ = 72\n\n__36 + 36__ = 72\n\n72 = 72 (LHS = RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options '22 – 13 – 85' is the odd one out.\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
